  "text": "### 7. Technology & Cybersecurity Risk  \n**Appetite:** Low  \n**Tolerance:**\n- **System Availability:** 99.8% (SLA)\n- **Major Data Breach:** Zero tolerance\n- **Cybersecurity Incidents:** <1 per year\n- **Unplanned Downtime:** <2 hours per year  \n**Rationale:**\nFirstUK Bank depends on reliable technology. Invests in security, resilience, and disaster recovery to maintain service availability and protect customer data.  \n**Controls:**\n- Regular security assessments\n- Penetration testing (annual)\n- Incident response planning\n- Disaster recovery procedures\n- Staff security training  \n---",
